{com}. 
. /* Now we specify an alternative coding, one where we count cases where both get an explicit no as zero's instead of missing data
> Yet we continue to count NRNR, NRNo, NoNR as missing data (not usable). */
. 
. gen ControlWins2=1 if newresult=="NRYes" | newresult=="NoYes" | newresult=="YesYes"
{txt}(205 missing values generated)

{com}. replace ControlWins2=0 if ControlWins2==.
{txt}(205 real changes made)

{com}. replace ControlWins2=. if newresult=="" | newresult=="NRNR" | newresult=="NRNo" | newresult=="NoNR"
{txt}(154 real changes made, 154 to missing)

{com}. 
. gen TestWins2=1 if newresult=="YesNR" | newresult=="YesNo" | newresult=="YesYes"
{txt}(235 missing values generated)

{com}. replace TestWins2=0 if TestWins2==.
{txt}(235 real changes made)

{com}. replace TestWins2=. if newresult=="" | newresult=="NRNR" | newresult=="NRNo" | newresult=="NoNR"
{txt}(154 real changes made, 154 to missing)

